OL,3,AAuthor says there were 'real concerns'
OL,4,Aabout David Walliams within publishing
OL,5,Aindustry
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuthor and columnist Chloe Combi has
OL,8,Fsaid she had heard rumours that there
OL,9,Fwere "real concerns" about David
OL,10,FWalliams's behaviour within the
OL,11,Fpublishing industry more than a decade
OL,12,Fago.
OL,14,FCombi told BBC News she had heard there
OL,15,Fwere allegations about his "behaviour
OL,16,Faround young female staff" and says she
OL,17,Fwas told in 2015 to warn schools that
OL,18,Fhe was "not an appropriate booking".
