OL,3,AAuthor says there were 'real concerns'
OL,4,Aabout David Walliams within publishing
OL,5,Aindustry
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn investigation by the Guardian and
OL,8,FITV News alleged that Walliams has been
OL,9,Faccused by several women of sexual
OL,10,Fmisconduct, inappropriate behaviour and
OL,11,Fabusing his position, which he denies.
OL,13,FHarperCollins, which published
OL,14,FWalliams's best-selling children's
OL,15,Fbooks, have been asked for comment on
OL,16,FCombi's claims.
